Package: aesopR
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Text Analysis of Aesop's Fables
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(
      "Dave", "Brocker",
      email = "davidabrocker@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Provides a tidy text corpus of public-domain Aesop's Fables
    sourced from the Library of Congress, along with tools for sentiment,
    emotion, and linguistic analysis of moral storytelling. The package
    includes both full narrative texts and tokenized representations to
    support exploratory text analysis, visualization, and teaching workflows.
